ontext":true,"contextText":"亲爱的已離開群聊。","eventKind":"","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:47:09.160Z","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5454,"deleted":true},{"id":1789694015258,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ab4216bf-aa8a-42fb-9505-7f775f331aec","senderName":"尤利西斯","text":"这种鬼天气简直是对精密关节的谋杀。右膝每走两步就发出一声刺耳的顿挫响，我甚至不想迈出房门半步。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:28.192Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5455},{"id":1789694015259,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"9d19b7b3-d459-46c3-b77a-6341aac527e9","senderName":"扬库·扎洛米尔","text":"纳帕克连脑袋都不肯从毛毯里探出来，南边的风从不带这种黏糊糊的霉气。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:31.101Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5456},{"id":1789694015260,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35b87f1b-532b-47f5-bfcd-6149e60035a1","senderName":"雅克·奥尔德鲁丁","text":"哈哈哈哈！你们都在屋里窝着啊？校场石板上全是霜水，刚才踩上去差点给我滑出半个身位，真够劲。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:32.709Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5457},{"id":1789694015261,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"2fd090de-6441-4fd0-932c-f0cb0092dd8b","senderName":"米尔恰·克拉约韦亚努 ","text":"@雅克·奥尔德鲁丁 桩步不稳就别怪地面打滑。扛两根石柱在走廊练负重，包你下盘踩得比老树根还死。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:35.338Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5458},{"id":1789694015262,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"35b87f1b-532b-47f5-bfcd-6149e60035a1","senderName":"雅克·奥尔德鲁丁","text":"得了吧，我要是在走廊上扛柱子蛙跳，巡查队长非得把我的重剑扣押了不可！","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:36.918Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5459},{"id":1789694015263,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"7acaff1e-da8c-495e-b468-9d9b6866b7d5","senderName":"泽拉提斯","text":"在平整地面上失足若是被登记进操典伤亡，后勤处只会把原因归咎于肢体不协调与脑力匮乏。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:39.727Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5460},{"id":1789694015264,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"18ba74f2-5dbb-449b-a6e6-4b07d97cacbd","senderName":"瓦莱里乌·巴兰","text":"若是衣物与皮革受潮，隐修会偏殿备了干艾草炉，诸位经过时可以顺路烘一烘手甲。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:44.801Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5461},{"id":1789694015265,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"3cd1c1d9-2733-4788-a3ff-cf6b6a1fafa4","senderName":"莱昂德尔","text":"温室的几盆蓝铃兰也有些打蔫，湿气过重根系容易发霉，我方才只得把侧面的通风口多推开了一指宽。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:47.560Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5462},{"id":1789694015266,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"67d4e7d5-381a-44ff-99e2-077c6f669f71","senderName":"临彦·萨伏伊","text":"阿姆林河口大雾未散，商船驳运减速。各部报备的耗材单据按规章顺延两小时入库，无须派人往库房催促。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:50.234Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5463},{"id":"sys_1789674530686_41","sender":"system","type":"system_notice","text":"菲尼克斯 授予 雅克·奥尔德鲁丁 頭銜「校场打滑冠军」","includeInContext":true,"contextText":"菲尼克斯 授予 雅克·奥尔德鲁丁 頭銜「校场打滑冠军」","eventKind":"management","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:50.686Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5464},{"id":1789694015267,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"0ddf4b64-629b-4cf4-81ae-2b8bd96deeb7","senderName":"菲尼克斯","text":"回廊近处禁止堆放带明火的器具。瓦莱里乌，你的艾草炉请置于下风口的避雨石亭内，免得烟气飘入内庭。","timestamp":"2026-09-17T19:48:53.381Z","roundId":"group_round_1789674489831_q3j64ct","userId":"uid_1782835188664_g77nhjqwl","characterId":"group_1789674415094","_id":5465},{"id":1789694015268,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"18ba74f2-5dbb-4